do CutsceneManager.fade_to_black()
#do CutsceneManager.play_sound(Lever)
#do CutsceneManager.play_sound(FireWhoosh)
do EventFlags.set_flag("heater_main_activated", true)
do CutsceneManager.fade_from_black()
do CutsceneManager.wait(2)
Wizard grit: [font_size=100][shake level=10 rate=50]NO WAITETH![/shake][/font_size]
Az annoy: [font_size=60]Oh [i]COME[/i] on.[/font_size]
Fenn worry: What happened?
Wizard: Waiteth- [wait=0.3][font_size=60][i]AHA![/i] Of course![/font_size]
Az annoy: [shake level=7 rate=30][i]UGH.[/i][/shake] I should've known.
Az: There's another heater in the [color="0B4F4A"]Cellar[/color], [wait=0.3]but it's [i]behind[/i] my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color]. 
Az annoy: So, [wait=0.3]the ice didn't melt all the way.
Wizard: [font_size=70]HAHA![/font_size][wait=0.3] [wave freq=7 amp=20]That was the planneth all along![/wave] [wait=0.3]  Go ahead, [shake level=7 amp=30][i]waste thy time.[/i][/shake]
Az annoy: Ignore him. Come back and we'll figure something out.
